# Cenotaph — build artifacts & local-only files

# Build outputs
/build/
*.o
*.obj

# Linked binaries + any test hosts (rebuild with `make`)
*.exe

# Packed beacon payload — NEVER commit. Cenotaph reads this as <exe-stem>.dat
# at runtime; it is built from the NaX fork and staged on the target.
*.dat
nax.x64.bin
*.bin

# Local test payloads / scratch
*.bin.bak
*.dat.bak
/test/
/scratch/

# CenKey.h is generated by tools/encrypt.py (XOR-obfuscated, safe to build from
# but treat any shipped exe+dat pair as keyed to the header it was built with).
# For a throwaway local key you never want staged, uncomment the next line.
# include/CenKey.h

# Local development / design-history log — not part of the published tool doc
docs/development.md

# Editor / OS cruft
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
.cache/